总所有笔记和 Book 的图片与附件。可以按名称搜索、点击 Insert 复用，并展开引用次数查看笔记标题和行号。零引用资源仍保留。检查覆盖受管理的 Markdown 图片与链接目标、引用定义和 MyST image/figure 参数，忽略代码示例中的字面引用；缺失文件会明确标注。","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"key":"oQpPCG2HzT"}],"key":"YDDc1lcZvA"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"导出与移动","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"key":"NN1EUQeWdT"}],"identifier":"id","label":"导出与移动","html_id":"id-2","implicit":true,"key":"ZrG6qHifes"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"将 Book 导出到空目录，引用的资源会复制到 assets/，嵌套页面的链接会转换为相对于该页面的路径。共用资源只复制一次，无关资源不导出，软件中的 Markdown 原文保持不变。必要资源缺失或损坏时，导出会停止并提示重新导入。","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"key":"ZY8zrQTKPT"}],"key":"xIBHb9sJ13"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"使用 jupyter book build --html --strict 构建，再通过本地 HTTP 服务查看。移动导出项目时保留整个文件夹，包括 assets/ 和网站主题文件，并重新检查图片及附件链接。","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"FB5X5qlnmK"}],"key":"RxrsC2qi3o"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"更改 Data Location 时会一起复制资源目录和清单。手动备份需同时保留 notes.json、assets.json 和 assets/。文献管理仍属于后续 Phase 3C。","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"key":"PkfPULlgmp"}],"key":"xAY7xwj9V2"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"验收","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"key":"ilMRISlKTZ"}],"identifier":"id","label":"验收","html_id":"id-3","implicit":true,"key":"LfUp0ETvJs"},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"导入一张图片和一个文档，然后移动原文件。","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"DlMKeiK3Hs"}],"key":"LghDYsBTvg"}],"key":"Ctsbkx1DE9"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1},"end":{"line":48,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"重启检查图片，另存附件副本并与原文件比较。","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1},"end":{"line":48,"column":1}},"key":"DCTdAlUzq1"}],"key":"s0oNtLs3uZ"}],"key":"qCXICIIzMn"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"在 Book 的嵌套页面复用资源，检查引用位置。","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"key":"ez6y98SDkX"}],"key":"BZwaVjobic"}],"key":"YeO7MPruw0"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"导出、构建、移动整个导出目录，再次验证图片和附件。","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":1},"end":{"line":50,"column":1}},"key":"QeIc4Ekike"}],"key":"O1ABmAdfZu"}],"key":"xWLWmskJuA"}],"key":"WFAyCotGJc"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1},"end":{"line":52,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resource tools update (1.8.1) / 资源工具更新","position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1},"end":{"line":52,"column":1}},"key":"a1bSoFyBby"}],"identifier":"resource-tools-update-1-8-1","label":"Resource tools update (1.8.1) / 资源工具更新","html_id":"resource-tools-update-1-8-1","implicit":true,"key":"lZ5HPSQgcL"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1},"end":{"line":54,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Same-name imports now ask: Replace existing updates ALL references to the managed resource; Keep both adds a numbered display name; Cancel imports nothing. Physical filenames remain hashes.","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1},"end":{"line":54,"column":1}},"key":"fwzdieLjC4"}],"key":"r5xl19wNKo"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1},"end":{"line":56,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resources → Show resources separates ordinary Notes from Books. Select one Book, one ordinary note, or Unreferenced; use the checkboxes and Delete selected for a batch. Delete checks references across the entire workspace, including other Books and Book logos, before asking for confirmation. Removing Markdown links retains resources. Confirmed resource deletion removes the managed file permanently; source links are left unchanged and will show missing-resource notices. Shared identical bytes stay on disk while another resource record still needs them. Original imported files and previously exported Books are unaffected. Attachment reading remains a future feature.","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1},"end":{"line":56,"column":1}},"key":"anz8ufPzdf"}],"key":"l7Du9XKPfv"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":58,"column":1},"end":{"line":58,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"同名导入现在弹出三个选项：Replace existing 替换所有原引用使用的资源；Keep both 给新资源显示名添加 (2)、(3) 等序号；Cancel 取消。磁盘继续使用哈希文件名。","position":{"start":{"line":58,"column":1},"end":{"line":58,"column":1}},"key":"M0T5gOE1Ar"}],"key":"SJdDQPriov"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":60,"column":1},"end":{"line":60,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resources → Show resources 区分普通 Notes 和 Books，可选某本书、某篇普通笔记或 Unreferenced（未引用）。勾选资源后点击 Delete selected 批量删除，单个资源也有 Delete。删除提示检查整个工作区的引用，包括其他书籍及书籍图标。仅删除正文链接会保留资源；确认永久删除资源才清除托管文件，正文中的旧链接不会自动改写，会提示资源缺失。若另一条资源记录仍共用相同文件，该文件会保留至最后一条记录被删除。电脑上的原始导入文件和已经导出的 Book 不受影响。软件内附件阅读留待后续开发。","position":{"start":{"line":60,"column":1},"end":{"line":60,"column":1}},"key":"K8uubJhjVK"}],"key":"tGHQ21kwPA"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":62,"column":1},"end":{"line":62,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deletion update (1.8.2) / 删除行为更新","position":{"start":{"line":62,"column":1},"end":{"line":62,"column":1}},"key":"UOwc7eGVXJ"}],"identifier":"deletion-update-1-8-2","label":"Deletion update (1.8.2) / 删除行为更新","html_id":"deletion-update-1-8-2","implicit":true,"key":"Nq3atyB5kE"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":64,"column":1},"end":{"line":64,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"From 1.8.2, confirming resource deletion also removes its image/link occurrences and image/figure blocks from ALL Notes and Books, and clears matching Book logos/favicons. Surrounding prose and literal code examples remain. This supersedes the 1.8.1 behavior described above. Removing only a link still keeps the resource.","position":{"start":{"line":64,"column":1},"end":{"line":64,"column":1}},"key":"ZTvkllfZPz"}],"key":"XqkRbLKv4P"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":1},"end":{"line":66,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"从 1.8.2 起，确认删除资源会同时移除所有笔记和 Book 中对应的图片、附件链接和 image/figure 图片块，并清除对应的书籍图标设置；周围正文和代码示例保留。此规则取代上文 1.8.1 的旧删除行为。仅删除正文引用仍保留资源文件。","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":1},"end":{"line":66,"column":1}},"key":"fBJTZ53Ioe"}],"key":"EGdqAKJSEM"},{"type":"comment","value":" phase-3-acceptance-attachment ","key":"G82JPhKzGA"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":69,"column":1},"end":{"line":69,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Acceptance attachment / 验收附件","position":{"start":{"line":69,"column":1},"end":{"line":69,"column":1}},"key":"nsvQyoKCHR"}],"identifier":"acceptance-attachment","label":"Acceptance attachment / 验收附件","html_id":"acceptance-attachment","implicit":true,"key":"sjhu6COQeQ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":71,"column":1},"end"